(122, 197, 'Conform', 'OK', 'The filling appearance is better than the CT result (the client has reviewed and is aware of the CT result). The appearance range (DRB) from the trial has been submitted to the client for review and approval.\r\n\r\nProduction Process:\r\n- Pre-heating: OFF\r\n- Filling\r\n- Post-heating: ON\r\n- Cooling\r\n- Aging at room temperature for 1–2 hours until the inner cap can be opened\r\n- Check the filling result                             \r\n\r\n\r\nIM Note:\r\n- Ensure the filling result is stable and the appearance complies with the client-approved standard (STD).\r\n- Ensure the bulk is completely melted before filling. Heat the bulk to 100–110°C (initial setpoint: 100°C) prior to the filling process.\r\n\r\nQuality Tests for the Filling Result:\r\n- Swing Test\r\n- Rub Test\r\n- Drop Test\r\n- Cutting Test', '2026-08-26 14:25:41'),
