(136, 107, 'Conform', 'OK', 'Pass. A follow-up trial is required to compare the filling appearance of the fresh bulk with the bulk after aging (RNI will provide support).\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE TRIAL: \r\n- flushingan pertama 15 kali (820g) dibuang\r\n- speed 6 skala\r\n- pengecekan warna: shake 10 kali, oles, lalu didiamkan 1 menit, cek warna\r\n- Formula pakai PB, sehingga ada salur (need confirmation client)(cth kowelrond, menyebabkan salur)\r\n- filling continoues, tidak boleh ada jeda\r\n- Bulk tidak boleh terkontaminasi udara, maksimal 1 menit\r\n- 9kg = setengah vessel lipcream\r\n\r\nSkema trial:\r\n1. Flushing 15 kali, filling (storage 1)\r\n2. Flushing sampai bulk setengah tanki, filling (storage 1)\r\n3. Flushing sampai bulk sedikit(bagian bawah) tanki, filling (storage 1), habiskan\r\n4. Isi bulk (storage 2) ke vessel, flushing 15 kali', '2026-08-03 17:31:08'),
